{"ID":"20240205153823-0un29ve","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153823-0un29ve","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153823-0un29ve\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103608-xlx0bir\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205160137-iadjylb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103608-xlx0bir\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:235,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:235\u0026#125;","title":"鸦胆子","type":"doc","updated":"20240903093450"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103608-xlx0bir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103608-xlx0bir","updated":"20240206103616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、福建、台湾等地。\n【性状】\t核果卵形或椭圆形，略扁，长0.61cm，直径47mm，表面黑色，有隆起网状皱纹，顶端有鸟嘴状短尖的花柱残基，腹背两侧有较明显的棱线，基部钝圆，有凹点状果柄痕，果肉易剥落；果核坚硬，破开后内面灰棕色平滑，内含种子1颗。种子卵形，长47mm，直径35mm，表面乳白色或黄白色，有稍隆起的网纹，顶端短尖呈鸟嘴状，其下有长圆形种脐，近基部有棕色圆形合点，种脐与合点间有稍隆起的种脊；种皮薄，胚乳和胚富油性。气微特异，味极苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有小毒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，止痢，截疟，腐蚀赘疣。用于痢疾、疟疾；外治赘疣、鸡眼。\n【炙品】\t鸦胆子霜：取净鸦胆子仁，炒热后研碎，用多层吸油纸包裹，压榨去油，反复数次，至松散成粉不再粘结成饼为度，取出碾细。贮干燥容器内，鸦胆子霜密闭，置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103609-jyadvd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103609-jyadvd2","updated":"20240206103609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103609-e76x8w9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160137-iadjylb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160137-iadjylb","updated":"20240205160137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸦胆子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸦胆子-20240205160137-botxva2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730170905-eg30g7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730170905-eg30g7r","updated":"20240730170905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 556px;","style":"width: 546px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸦胆子 (19)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸦胆子 19-20240730170905-elrukpb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 546px;\" parent-style=\"width: 556px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730164151-4syxzwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730164151-4syxzwf","updated":"20240730170400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 449px;","style":"width: 439px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸦胆子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸦胆子-20240730164151-ecddwla.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 439px;\" parent-style=\"width: 449px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸦胆子 (16)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸦胆子 16-20240730170400-xnvl803.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240730164923-e9z8k35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Prop